WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Before ending a shift, test the handoff as if you were the incoming lead.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.830
Open the ticket by number, verify its status and owner, and read the latest follow-up for the next action.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:19.250
If the work is escalated, compare the current rung with its history so you can say who needs to decide what, rather than just reporting that the ticket is open.
